[sub_resource type="GDScript" id="GDScript_tipki"]
script/source = "extends Sprite2D
## The tiled cobblestone floor. This node draws its own texture (it IS the
## sprite) — no child node needed, so there's nothing to look up here.
## Darkening and the anti-tiling variation live entirely in the ShaderMaterial
## on this node — see assets/shaders/background_detile.gdshader for the knobs
## (Darkness, Variation Strength, Randomize Flip), tunable right on this node
## in the Inspector.
"

